Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-01T17:12:58Z","updated_at":"2025-08-01T17:12:58Z","body":"- Related to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/97728.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3145238219/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3222875309","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107552#issuecomment-3222875309","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107552","id":3222875309,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7AGSyt","user":{"login":"Kaleb-Reid","id":78945904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4OTQ1OTA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78945904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid","html_url":"https://github.com/Kaleb-Reid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kaleb-Reid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-26T06:58:15Z","updated_at":"2025-08-26T06:58:15Z","body":"I've spent a little more time looking into this and I think I've found the problem. Also I've realized that this bug doesn't happen on canvas shaders, only spatial shaders.\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/46c495ca21f40f57a7fb9c7cde6143738f1652d4/drivers/gles3/rasterizer_scene_gles3.cpp#L2311-L2316 When glow is enabled, the luminance multiplier is set to 1/4, which causes things to be rendered at 1/4 brightness internally.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/46c495ca21f40f57a7fb9c7cde6143738f1652d4/drivers/gles3/rasterizer_scene_gles3.cpp#L2711-L2717 Much later but before the transparent pass, the color buffer is blitted to the texture provided as the screen texture.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/46c495ca21f40f57a7fb9c7cde6143738f1652d4/drivers/gles3/rasterizer_scene_gles3.cpp#L2755 https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/46c495ca21f40f57a7fb9c7cde6143738f1652d4/drivers/gles3/rasterizer_scene_gles3.cpp#L2865 After the transparent pass, the glow is applied which brings the brightness back up to proper levels, except the screen texture has already been copied by this point at 1/4 brightness.\n\nMy understanding is that the fix for this is to multiply the texture's values by 1 / luminance multiplier right after being blitted to the screen texture, but honestly I don't know what the proper way to do that is.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3222875309/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart"